1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:03,380
Someone you really like just texts you…

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:06,153
“So when are you taking me out?”

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:11,772
And suddenly, you’re rewriting the same reply over and over.

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,630
You know what you mean.

5
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:18,732
You just can’t find the right words.

6
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:24,130
Now imagine having ReplyRight inside your keyboard.

7
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:26,299
Copy their message,

8
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,930
open ReplyRight,

9
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,956
and paste it in.

10
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:33,530
Choose how you want to sound.

11
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,941
Let’s go with flirty.

12
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,830
And there it is.

13
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:42,530
“That depends. Are you free this Saturday?”

14
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:47,330
Tap Use Reply, and it’s right in your message box.

15
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:51,088
No switching back and forth between apps.

16
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,530
Want early access?

17
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,611
Comment REPLY.

